}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATC04omLk", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 79, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8747374, "raw_content": ".", "author": "FlyinHeadlock", "created": 1785032035336, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "DonnieRamesJio", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "George Jefferson frequently called his neighbor Tom Willis a \"honky\" on the television show The Jeffersons. Honky is an insulting slang word used in the United States to describe a white person. If Willis calls him something WIllis is charged with a crime. FUCK THIS BS. ", "last_comment_created": 1785037018361, "content": "<p>.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 79, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATC04psHR", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 12, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "hat", "id": 8747739, "raw_content": "https://www.givesendgo.com/shilohhendrix\n\nHello! \n\n\n\nI hope everyone is doing well!\n\n\n\n I just got back home to my sons yesterday after being away from them for several days due to my trial. It\u2019s the longest time I\u2019ve ever been separated from them. I missed them so much. I can\u2019t even imagine if they had jailed me for this. My family\u2019s hearts would have been broken. I\u2019m so grateful to be home.\n\n \n\nI have had an excellent team with me throughout this whole thing. My husband has never left my side. Tom Hennessy was reporting the truth the whole time to keep you all updated. My lawyer, Brian Karalus, has proven to be the perfect person for this case. I also had a group of patriots serve as my security. I am so thankful for them all. \n\n\n\n**I also wanted to add that I am not on social media. I have been told that there is someone out there impersonating me. Don\u2019t fall for their tricks.** (emphasis mine)\n\n\n\nWe all know the verdict. We all know how unfair and unjust it is. This is why I will be appealing. Things are already in motion to do so. I will never stop fighting, and all of you give me so much strength and hope to keep my head in the battle. I don\u2019t know what I would do without all of your support. You\u2019ve all proven time and time again how great we can be when we stick together. It makes my heart happy.\n\n \n\nThank you for staying by my side.\n\nThank you for showing the world what we can do.\n\nThank you for helping me protect my family.\n\nThank you for everything.\n\n\n\nShiloh", "author": "uxername27", "created": 1785068853537, "profile_picture": "NreavRYIB637", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Trooph-Hurts", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Shiloh update from her GSG.", "last_comment_created": 1785069513548, "content": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.givesendgo.com/shilohhendrix\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.givesendgo.com/shilohhendrix</a></p>\n<p>Hello!</p>\n<p>I hope everyone is doing well!</p>\n<p>I just got back home to my sons yesterday after being away from them for several days due to my trial. It\u2019s the longest time I\u2019ve ever been separated from them. I missed them so much. I can\u2019t even imagine if they had jailed me for this. My family\u2019s hearts would have been broken. I\u2019m so grateful to be home.</p>\n<p>I have had an excellent team with me throughout this whole thing. My husband has never left my side. Tom Hennessy was reporting the truth the whole time to keep you all updated. My lawyer, Brian Karalus, has proven to be the perfect person for this case. I also had a group of patriots serve as my security. I am so thankful for them all.</p>\n<p><strong>I also wanted to add that I am not on social media. I have been told that there is someone out there impersonating me. Don\u2019t fall for their tricks.</strong> (emphasis mine)</p>\n<p>We all know the verdict. We all know how unfair and unjust it is. This is why I will be appealing. Things are already in motion to do so. I will never stop fighting, and all of you give me so much strength and hope to keep my head in the battle. I don\u2019t know what I would do without all of your support. You\u2019ve all proven time and time again how great we can be when we stick together. It makes my heart happy.</p>\n<p>Thank you for staying by my side.</p>\n<p>Thank you for showing the world what we can do.</p>\n<p>Thank you for helping me protect my family.</p>\n<p>Thank you for everything.</p>\n<p>Shiloh</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 12, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "SAVE AMERICA", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC04oV2G", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 104, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8747238, "raw_content": "", "author": "TateDe